---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Coherence Log">
  <article>
    <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
    <h1>About Coherence Log</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Malaika, a PhD researcher at TU Wien's Atominstitut in Vienna,
      working on quantum sensing — spin defects in hexagonal boron nitride,
      ODMR-based sensing, and photonic integration toward a chip-scale
      sensing module.
    </p>
    <p>
      Coherence Log tracks what I find genuinely interesting in that world,
      plus software engineering trends I run into along the way. New
      entries land roughly every ten days, drafted with AI assistance from
      recent papers and articles, then reviewed and edited by me before
      they go live.
    </p>
    <p>
      Questions, corrections, or something you think I should cover? Reach
      out via the contact page.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
